%% NEXUS_11 v0.6.0 + KETTE12 End-to-End-Ablauf
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant I as Intent Producer
  participant A as @nexus11/cli-adapter
  participant C as nexus11-core
  participant T as Golden Test Vectors
  participant B as Hermetic Builder
  participant V as Verification Gate
  participant R as Rekor/OIDC/Provenance
  participant W as WORM Archive
  participant U as Nexus Command Center

  T->>C: Verify input -> JCS -> state transition -> hash/signature
  I->>A: Submit protocol-relevant action
  A->>C: Delegate action via typed subprocess
  C->>C: Enforce operation class and deterministic invariants
  C-->>A: Canonical state, signatures, BLAKE3 root
  A-->>I: Return authoritative result
  B->>R: Produce SBOM, provenance, OIDC identity, inclusion evidence
  B->>V: Submit artifact digest + build evidence
  C->>V: Submit subject digest + signed evidence
  V->>R: Validate provenance correlation and Rekor inclusion
  alt All checks pass
    V->>W: Persist compliance artifacts and chmod 444
    V->>U: Publish read-only report.json evidence
    U->>U: Render happy path and mutated fixture comparison
  else Any mismatch
    V-->>B: Fail closed with exit code != 0
    V-->>U: Withhold success state
  end
